    "duplicateText": "PPTX edits always require slideId + elementId and obtain XML offsets from the parsed source node. There is no byte-search mutation API. The actual service rejects an identity-free text matcher and rejects injected findText even with an ID; duplicate source IDs fail with a readable Chinese error before editing. This executes the existing Y11 ambiguity-rejection requirement through the implemented structural authority, not a new byte-search helper.",
