    "negativeControl": "A deliberately naive replaceAll corrupts both text bodies. The independent preservation oracle fails on the other object. This is a test negative control; production rejection is separately demonstrated at the strict service contract and duplicate-identity parser.",
    "sharedStrings": "One vs three references across two actual worksheets: unique item updated in place; shared item copied, only chosen cell index changes; all other sheet bytes and rich-run formatting retained. Final actual Worker/native checkpoint/save/reopen 2/2."
  },
